v 3
d BUMIDAS for Stata
d
d Stata commands for mixed-frequency data construction and forecasting.
d Includes bumidas for Bottom-Up Mixed-Frequency Data Sampling estimation
d and model selection, mfcollapse for constructing mixed-frequency data,
d umidas for unrestricted MIDAS, and rmidas for restricted MIDAS.
d
d Version 0.2.0
d Author: Stephen Snudden
d Wilfrid Laurier University
d https\://github.com/SSEconomics/bumidas-stata
d
d Distribution-Date: 20261001
d
f stata/bumidas.ado
f stata/bumidas_p.ado
f stata/bumidas.sthlp
f stata/mfcollapse.ado
f stata/mfcollapse.sthlp
f stata/umidas.ado
f stata/umidas_p.ado
f stata/umidas.sthlp
f stata/rmidas.ado
f stata/rmidas_p.ado
f stata/nlrmidas_lse.ado
f stata/rmidas.sthlp
e
